<DocsLayout title="Lua & LSL Docs">
<div class="dashboard summary-constant">
  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`CHANGED_TEXTURE: number = 16`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`integer CHANGED_TEXTURE = 16;`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>The integer constant CHANGED_TEXTURE has the value 0x10</p>
  <p>Prim texture parameters (shine/bump setting, repeats, flip, rotation, or offset) have changed.</p>
  <p>Transparency or color changes trigger a <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/CHANGED_COLOR" target="_blank">CHANGED_COLOR</a> event not a CHANGED_TEXTURE event.</p>
</p>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Member Of</div>
